{"parse":{"title":"个性/血羽之志","pageid":5879,"revid":13724,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E7%BE%BD%E4%B9%8B%E5%BF%97&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E7%BE%BD%E4%B9%8B%E5%BF%97&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E8%A1%80%E7%BE%BD%E4%B9%8B%E5%BF%97&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>血羽之志</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.A1.80.E7.BE.BD.E4.B9.8B.E5.BF.97\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"血羽之志\"><b>血羽之志</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 血羽之志.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cd/o08ylzki9hxgqun5fcq3cgszb7a4sdu.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E8%A1%80%E7%BE%BD%E4%B9%8B%E5%BF%97.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cd/o08ylzki9hxgqun5fcq3cgszb7a4sdu.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E8%A1%80%E7%BE%BD%E4%B9%8B%E5%BF%97.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/cd/o08ylzki9hxgqun5fcq3cgszb7a4sdu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />血羽之志\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"跳跃\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">跳跃</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强力不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">强力不屈</font></span></span>]，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">不屈</font></span></span>]时获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"偏斜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">偏斜</font></span></span>]。可翻越友军、敌人、中立角色、物品。[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">普攻</span>]时，可攻击相邻敌人。场上所有敌人受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"如影随形\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">如影随形</font></span></span>]光环影响。<br />✦拥有额外技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"布羽为谋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">布羽为谋</font></span></span>]。回合开始时，使下次使用此技能时变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]且不消耗能量，此效果冷却<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>回合。<br />✦防御提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，自身物防值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>附加在攻击上，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"偏斜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">偏斜</font></span></span>]生效时受到伤害或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%8A%E7%91%9F%E7%90%B3%E5%BE%B7\" title=\"角色图鉴库/伊瑟琳德\"><img alt=\"头像 伊瑟琳德.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/19/6kxpuae0q0apma6hpdb0aevph2gq0ep.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">伊瑟琳德</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>效果提升为：✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"跳跃\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">跳跃</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"强力不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">强力不屈</font></span></span>]，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"不屈\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">不屈</font></span></span>]时获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"偏斜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">偏斜</font></span></span>]。可翻越友军、敌人、中立角色、物品。[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">普攻</span>]时，可攻击相邻敌人。场上所有敌人受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"如影随形\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">如影随形</font></span></span>]光环影响。<br />✦拥有额外技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"布羽为谋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">布羽为谋</font></span></span>]。回合开始时，使下次使用此技能时变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"瞬发\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">瞬发</font></span></span>]且不消耗能量，此效果冷却<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>回合。<br />✦防御提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，自身物防值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>附加在攻击上，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"偏斜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">偏斜</font></span></span>]生效时受到伤害或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">40%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-b